    <!-- IR CODES.  Ids 101/102/103/106/107/137/138/139 are Control4's CONVENTIONAL receiver
         IR code ids, identical across every receiver IR driver in the catalog, so they are used
         here rather than invented ones.

         PROVENANCE, AND WHY THESE ARE CANDIDATES: the patterns below were taken from Control4's
         own Yamaha YSP-1000 IR driver (receiver_ir_yamaha_ysp-1000.c4i).  That is a 2005 soundbar
         and this is a 2019 YAS-209 - Yamaha reuses system codes across its line, so power /
         volume / mute have a fair chance of working, but NOTHING here is confirmed on the YAS-209.
         Run Actions -> Verify IR Codes: it fires each code and reads the result back over the IP
         path, so every code gets an objective pass/fail instead of a guess.
         Codes the YAS-209 has and these do not (input select, sound programs, subwoofer trim)
         must be learned from the real remote. See README "IR". -->
